Comment: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:21.41,EG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)\be2\pos(1278,218.247)}{\pos(2008,327.747)}#Encodergasm Presents
Comment: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.23,0:01:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A half-century has passed since humanity began moving...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...its burgeoning population into space.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These gigantic space colonies orbiting the Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:45.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...became a second home to humanity...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.91,0:01:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...where people were born and raised...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and where they died.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:02:01.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is the year 0079 of the Universal Century.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:05.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The colonies of Side 3 proclaimed themselves\Nthe Principality of Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:08.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It launched a war of independence\Nagainst the Earth Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}During this war, the Principality of Zeon\Nand the Federation...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...caused the deaths\Nof half the total population.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.57,0:02:23.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Humanity was horrified by its own actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:57.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Group 3. Your meals are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:59.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right! Amuro's got to eat too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:07.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! It's time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:08.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! It's time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:10.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A-mu-ro...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:20.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:23.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're tired, do you want to skip the meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:30.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a decent night's sleep\Nsince leaving Side 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:35.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even when I have the time, I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to talk to Ms. Sayla about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't she a medical student?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:42.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit bugging me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:45.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! This isn't like you, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.91,0:03:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a lot less like me\Nto fight in a mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This war's killed practically every adult!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Old people and kids younger than you have to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:58.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the same for Zeon\Nand the Federation. Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop biting your nails. It's a bad habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation is using us as a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Decoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation is developing\Neven newer weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.14,0:04:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to distract the enemy\Nuntil they're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:18.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a decoy. That's all we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're over-thinking things. You should rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll set aside your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:27.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? No contact yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incoming transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's probably from General HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Defense HQ.{\i}\N{\i1}Use decryption circuit Alpha Gain.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alpha Gain. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It says the White Base is to break through\Nenemy lines and escape to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:49.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're not coming to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Can't we talk to them?\NWith General HQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in Zeon territory,\Nand even coded transmissions aren't safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What could the generals be thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.15,0:05:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't know what goes on in the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tamura. The meals for the elderly...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:12.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, of course there's no way\Nfor us to prove it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's slander!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could I have time to eat well\Nwhen I'm so busy cooking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you do look suspiciously healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll ask you straight out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:26.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is it that only Amuro and Ryu\Nget bigger portions?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright's orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're to treat them like regular pilots!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:32.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:34.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're fighting too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A soldier's calorie intake is adjusted according to his workload!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't quarrel in here, Mr. Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Talk to Mr. Bright or Lt. Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:44.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:53.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give you something nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:53.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:56.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kikka...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:01.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, Don't tell anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:10.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're getting low on ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It won't last us through another battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know. That's why I'm thinking\Nof how we can get through this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:20.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's easy if all you want to do\Nis survive, Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:21.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can abandon the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:26.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Reed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:32.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have some of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:49.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:50.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need to eat properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then don't make me eat in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:55.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what was it all for...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of our fighting up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone here has grown more confident\Nthey can carry on in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:10.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright! All repairs to damaged areas\Nhave been completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Hayato and Sayla?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're on gun maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:17.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll send out a patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:24.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! I'm sending you out on patrol.{\i}\N{\i1}Report to the bridge!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What are you doing? Hurry!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why stir things up by sending out a patrol?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.06,0:07:38.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:42.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, you're always sending me out{\i}\N{\i1}to fight. I'm sick of it!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:46.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro's exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And we rely on him too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato and I will go on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:03.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let the computer fly it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:06.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! That's what I'm trying to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Set the computer to automatically\Nfollow my plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:13.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:20.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:31.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Garma, surely there's no need\Nfor you to go personally. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to consider what my sister\Nmight think of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you have no family,\Nyou wouldn't understand my problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare for sortie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.83,0:08:44.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enemy fighters, sir!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:47.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Garma! Cancel the sortie. Get back!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going now, and I'll shoot them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:54.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come back, Garma.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu! Why aren't we attacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, we managed to find the Gaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:05.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd be able to attack the Gaw\Nif we had another six Core Fighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:12.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This image was from 30 seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:17.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It could mean the Trojan Horse is\Ngetting impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:18.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting impatient?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:21.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the first patrol the Trojan Horse\Nhas sent out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:26.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They must have some weakness.\NThat's why they're checking our movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:27.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:31.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Instead of attacking the small fry,\Nwe should go for the real prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Pursue the enemy patrol!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transfer the Core Fighters to the Guncannon\Nand Guntank immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back into the coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:01.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll head up. Take over here, Mr. Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.91,0:10:03.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not used to this, so help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:04.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe you'd understand,\NFraw Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:11.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even Mr. Kai's in the Guncannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all prepared to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll eventually get sick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's different for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been forced to go out, over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is it, Fraw Bow?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro's not up to it.\NHe says he doesn't want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:34.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Listen! You have to sortie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you guarantee\NI'll be able to sleep soundly afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:42.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guarantee?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:43.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:46.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't help how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:52.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you didn't go out and fight for us...\NI would've been dead long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the same for me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... I'm tired of being scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:12.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whew! A safe landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:14.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All clear, Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:21.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, my, is this all the fighting strength\Nwe've got? Eh, Mr. Bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gundam will be joining you soon.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have confidence in our fighting strength.{\i}\N{\i1}All right?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:30.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. You sure know how\Nto make me feel better, Ms. Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:34.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try to fulfill your duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:37.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you fighting, Mr. Bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:41.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for philosophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand up, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to deploy the Gundam so badly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you should go out in it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:51.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd do it if I could!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be told by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have to do it, just because I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... You hit me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:06.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't I hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:10.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine! Go ahead and throw your tantrums.\NMaybe you'll feel better then!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:14.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Do you really think\NI'm such a petty person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:42.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reinforcements from the left flank!\NRyu, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:47.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Kai, don't go too far ahead\Nand get shot down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato, we're getting low on ammo!\NAim well!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Char, can you hear me?\NI know why the Trojan Horse is impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:13:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, that's good. So what's the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:02.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the mobile suit.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:06.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are two land-combat types out,{\i}\N{\i1}but not the one in question.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:08.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suspect they can't deploy it.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't interfere. Just watch, Char.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to seeing\Nyour splendid attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:22.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Concentrate your fire on the left engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guncannon, Guntank. Enemy is firing\Non port side. Requesting cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:33.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bastards...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hit me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not even my father ever hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you're such a spoiled brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:55.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me a real man\Nwho's grown up without being hit once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it! I refuse to go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll never get in the Gundam again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! That's enough!\NGet a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be so pathetic, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm off to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, right now\Nyou're no better than an insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.45,0:14:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Given your great talent...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:21.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I thought you'd be able to surpass Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.39,0:14:25.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:33.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, there's a manual on\Nhow to operate the Gundam, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.48,0:14:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll pilot the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate people who won't take pride\Nin what they can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:44.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, if you can't proudly declare that\Nyou protected the White Base until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:47.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you're not a real man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:54.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can pilot the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate to say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but I guess I am a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:07.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro. Are you going? Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:12.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn that Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.05,0:15:17.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu, the enemy's only firing\Nat the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rotate to the right!\N
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:18.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I only hit one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:29.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't shoot down fighters\Nwithout anti-aircraft weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beebe, don't waste time on the small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just the Trojan Horse.\NJust aim for the Trojan Horse's engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:39.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, Captain!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:41.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! The Dopps are concentrating fire{\i}\N{\i1}on the White Base's port side engine.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can handle an anti-air combat, right?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:51.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:54.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'd like to try a new battle tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need the Guntank and Guncannon\Nto cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.98,0:16:00.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll pass it on.{\i}\N{\i1}We're counting on you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm quite impressed by\NCaptain Garma's attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:09.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He didn't get to be a captain\Nmerely because of his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:13.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Commander, is this all right?\NJust to watch like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:17.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said he'd request assistance\Nif he needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we interfere without his asking,\Nit'll hurt his pride... and we'll get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can still use the radio\Nat this distance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. The Minovsky particle density\Nhasn't changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but we should at least get audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get scolded by Garma either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you've come out, damned mobile suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it is a ground combat weapon after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:50.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beebe squadron, attack the mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam does have jumping abilities,\Nand rocket nozzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:04.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The mobile suit is flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:05.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,1...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:12.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam is engaged in aerial combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:13.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cancel the radio restriction! Sayla!\NInstruct the Guntank and Guncannon...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.51,0:17:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...to cover the Gundam\Nso he can land without being fired upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:23.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guntank, Guncannon.\NCan you see the Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:30.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Amuro is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:31.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Let's cover him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:32.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just have to keep the Dopps\Nat high altitude, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:39.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting the Dopps any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,8... 5... 2... 0...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The mobile suit is jumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:52.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's practically flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation has built\Nan unbelievable mobile suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,3...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:17.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:20.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at the way Amuro's fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's terrific. Even when he was\Nsulking, he was still thinking how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:29.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, you've gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:33.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,6... and the next will be 7...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:41.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,7...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That must be the squadron leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:59.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You monster! Go down! Go down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:03.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,T-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:12.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's good...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:16.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you read, Gaw? It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:18.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll lure the mobile suit\Naway from the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:22.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once it's within the Gaw's range,\Nshoot the mobile suit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.81,0:19:25.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:32.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know he's entering\Nthe Gaw's beam cannon range.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gaw! Fire! At the mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:41.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.36,0:19:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gaw! It's me! It's Garma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?\NI'm sure it's transmitting on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:00.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.60,0:20:02.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:06.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Federation transport?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.77,0:20:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You, in the mobile suit. Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you cross the mountains,\Nthe Gaw will get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:15.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get back to White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She seems to know everything, but...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:25.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With all the dirt on this plug, it's no wonder\Nradio communications were faulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:28.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief Engineer, you can expect\Ndisciplinary action!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.37,0:20:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you're no better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:33.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I concur.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.38,0:20:36.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you saw the action\Non the laser scope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even without any contact from me,\Nyou should have taken some measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:43.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's because I didn't want\Nto hurt your pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:45.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:48.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You told me to just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:50.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And with your skills, Garma...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:54.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I had faith that you'd be able to\Ndeal with such minor damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:57.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:20:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The unfortunate thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...when we tried to shoot down\Nthe enemy transport...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:06.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you were in its direct path, Garma.\NSo we couldn't fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.\NAs long as you understand, Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:21.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All Salamis crew including Lt. Reed...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:24.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...plus the sick and injured refugees.\NWe're taking 35 people in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.67,0:21:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As for the White Base and the mobile suits...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we have no new orders,\Nso they'll remain as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.43,0:21:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, I request copies\Nof your combat records...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:36.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...under orders from General Revil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Lt. Matilda, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are they keeping us\Nwith the ship as is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:48.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,General Revil says if the White Base\Ncan continue to fight as it has...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it's the same as any regular forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation's facing some tough times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:56.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:59.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...have come this far only\Nat General Revil's request.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.71,0:22:02.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with General HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:05.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And? Will we be resupplied again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can escape from Zeon airspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.10,0:22:17.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember that some in the Federation\Nhave not abandoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:26.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without your fighting skills,\Nwe would be dead too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may be some kind of esper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.95,0:22:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No way, not me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:34.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.24,0:22:35.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.51,0:22:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Matilda departs, leaving only\Na fleeting hint of fragrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.97,0:22:55.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.22,0:22:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...this is his first experience\Nof the scent of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:18.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Garma can't fail to destroy\Nthe White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.91,0:23:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...as he feels his romance with Icelina\Nhinges upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.83,0:23:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Garma Zabi launches his final assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While Amuro and crew\Nbattle terror in the dark...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:32.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Char's plot unfolds,\Nsealing Garma's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.55,0:23:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Garma's Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
